  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Matte Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Waterproof</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Without Coal Tar</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Long-wearing</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Liquid Formula</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean at Sephora</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A clean, carbon black-free liquid eyeliner delivering the blackest black*, long-lasting matte finish in a custom, calligraphy-inspired brush.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Benefits: </strong>Long-wearing, Waterproof</p><p><strong><br>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></strong></p><p >- Charcoal Pigment: Delivers clean, intense black pigment and optimal ink flow.</p><p>- Herbal Flower Complex: Known to boost longwear performance + protect skin.</p><p>- Panthenol: Derived from vitamin B5, known to condition + nourish skin.</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-For optimal performance, shake the pen before each use and store flat with cap closed tightly. <br>-If the brush tip starts to feel dry, simply wipe with a damp paper towel to re-activate ink flow. <br>-Applying setting powder and allowing eyeliner to dry fully will minimize smudging on more oily eyelids.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\"><p >- Charcoal Pigment: Delivers clean, intense black pigment and optimal ink flow.</p><p>- Herbal Flower Complex: Known to boost longwear performance + protect skin.</p><p>- Panthenol: Derived from vitamin B5, known to condition + nourish skin.</p><p><br></p><p>Aqua (Water, Eau), Charcoal Powder, Ammonium Styrene/Acrylates Copolymer, Butylene Glycol, 1,2-Hexanediol, Glycerin, Campsis Grandiflora Flower Extract, Eclipta Prostrata Extract, Paeonia Suffruticosa Root Extract, Panthenol, Pentylene Glycol, Caprylyl Glycol, Ethylhexylglycerin, Sodium Dilauramidoglutamide Lysine, Iodopropynyl Butylcarbamate.</p></div></details>",
